{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_01","textHome":"我是PROMISED BLOOD的一员，@铃鹿朔夜。最近刚转学到神滨的学校。@啊，转学的原因不能说，@不过我可没做什么亏心事！@……你是神滨的魔法少女，@对吧？若想和平收场，@最好别和我牵扯太深。"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.2,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":300}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.8,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":1}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":200}]}],"group_10":[{"autoTurnFirst":2.8,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":1,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_17","textHome":"青可不只是个游戏宅。@她不仅擅长游戏，@现实中也很聪明，@总能想出必胜作战，特别可靠！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.3,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":200}]}],"group_11":[{"autoTurnFirst":2.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":300,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_18","textHome":"结菜……以前明明不是会被愤怒@冲昏头脑的人……。@不过她温柔的一面并没有改变。@总有一天，她会变回原来的结菜吧……？"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":0}]}],"group_12":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":400,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_19","textHome":"哦！？我好像突然明白了！@就是那个吧，所谓“进入状态”！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100}]}],"group_13":[{"autoTurnFirst":5.2,"chara":[{"cheek":1,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_20","textHome":"唔——嗯，太舒服了！@力量正在从身体里不断涌出来！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100}]}],"group_14":[{"autoTurnFirst":5.7,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":1,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_21","textHome":"和既没有魔女也没有悲叹之种的二木相比，@现在已经好太多了。@因为我们能够抱着希望，@相信跟随三姐妹就一定会获救！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100}]}],"group_15":[{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":0,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_22","textHome":"队伍今后的方向由结菜她们三姐妹决定，@我只要做好自己能做的事。@……虽然我大概只能支援结菜，@但只要她还需要我，@我就会一直陪在她身边。"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.8,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.6,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":6.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100}]}],"group_16":[{"autoTurnFirst":6.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":300,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_23","textHome":"魔法少女彼此争斗，若能避免，@我当然不愿意。可是，只要还有人伤害结菜、@光……以及其他伙伴，我就只能战斗。@哪怕对手并非我能战胜……@在彻底燃尽之前，我也不会停下！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.4,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.6,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.5,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":200}]}],"group_17":[{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_24","textHome":"哟！今天要练哪个部位？@好，腘绳肌对吧！@力量训练还能锻炼意志力，@说不定对魔法少女也有效哦！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.2,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.8,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":1}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100}]}],"group_18":[{"autoTurnFirst":1.6,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":0,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_25","textHome":"早上好！我正要去慢跑，@你当然也会一起来吧！？@运动过后吃的早餐可是最棒的！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":1}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.3,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.0,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100}]}],"group_19":[{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":300,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_26","textHome":"呜……肚子好饿～。……@好，提前吃午饭吧。……@咦，这很普通吧？@正值发育期的女生都会这么做吧！？"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.3,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.6,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100}]}],"group_2":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.3,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":200,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_02","textHome":"初次见面！我是铃鹿朔夜，@叫我朔夜就好。……啊，抱歉，@是不是太自来熟了？@我会尽量不给你添麻烦，总之请多关照！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.4,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.2,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100}]}],"group_20":[{"autoTurnFirst":2.4,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":0,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_27","textHome":"啊，到社团活动时间了！好，@今天也鼓足干劲，痛快地狂奔一场吧！@……不行不行！得注意别太显眼……"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.2,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100}]}],"group_21":[{"autoTurnFirst":2.4,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":1,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_28","textHome":"好，睡觉！想变强，@睡眠也是重要因素。啊！？@作业……还没做……不过！@明天的我一定会努力！好，睡觉！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.6,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.7,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.4,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.8,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100}]}],"group_22":[{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":200,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_29","textHome":"听说最近锻炼身体的女生变多了！@时代终于追上我了……@等等！被追上可不行，@必须把她们远远甩开！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.4,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":100}]}],"group_23":[{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_30","textHome":"好，该活动了……。@啊，当然是指讨伐魔女！@怎么可能还有别的意思！@那么，出发巡逻！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":1}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":6.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":200}]}],"group_24":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.3,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":0,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_31","textHome":"如果在无尽镜界遇见我的复制体，@我想至少比一次速度。@不是常说“最大的敌人是自己”吗！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.5,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100}]}],"group_25":[{"autoTurnFirst":4.2,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":300,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_32","textHome":"无论经历多少次，@团队战还是会紧张。@不能因为我的失误让大家陷入危机。@……呼，打起精神上吧！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100}]}],"group_26":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_33","textHome":"没问题，只要做就一定能做到！@就算现在不安，@自信之后自然会跟上！没问题没问题！@加油加油！终点就在前方！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.8,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.0,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":100}]}],"group_27":[{"autoTurnFirst":4.2,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":200,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_34","textHome":"我正打算去应聘搬家兼职！@家里已经迁就我转学@的任性要求了，@我也得尽量报答他们！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.3,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":1}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100}]}],"group_28":[{"autoTurnFirst":7.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":1,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_35","textHome":"唉……不知道家里的球@鞋收藏还好吗。@那当然会担心啊！只要我没盯着，@妈妈就会擅自拿来穿！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":7.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":300}]}],"group_29":[{"autoTurnFirst":5.5,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":400,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_36","textHome":"呜、唔……好想吃……不行，@要忍住！拉面会长胖……@拉面不能变成肌肉……@但拉面真的很好吃……啊！好想吃！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.2,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.5,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":1}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.2,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":300}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.9,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":400}]}],"group_3":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.8,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":300,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_03","textHome":"唔……真伤脑筋……接下来怎么办？"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":302100}]}],"group_30":[{"autoTurnFirst":2.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_37","textHome":"真是的！为什么“随机应变”“灵活”@这些词就这么不适合我啊！@我明明也想像兰华一样处理得游刃有余……"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":6.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":6.0,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":300}]}],"group_31":[{"autoTurnFirst":5.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":1,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_38","textHome":"唉……真拿她没办法。@二姐使唤人也太不客气了。@不过委托越困难，我反而越有干劲！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.8,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100}]}],"group_32":[{"autoTurnFirst":4.5,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":300,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_39","textHome":"有时……我会做很可怕的梦。@梦见从前的朋友追着我……是我…@…不，没什么……真的没什么……"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":6.0,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.8,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100}]}],"group_33":[{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":400,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_40","textHome":"恋、恋爱什么的我完全不懂！@以前倒是有喜欢的人，@可我一告白就立刻被拒绝，@惨败而归——啊啊，我到底在说什么！？"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":300}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.2,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100}]}],"group_34":[{"autoTurnFirst":2.5,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":100,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_3021_00_41","textHome":"……998、999、1000！@呼——结束了！@我就是喜欢练完后的成就感！那么，@腹肌怎么样……嗯，练得真漂亮！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":1}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"id":302100,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":6.0,"chara":[{"cheek":2,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":200}]}],"group_35":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":302100,"motion":200,"p